@*
    The Razor parity twin's entry view (D1; ledger entry E5) — the counterpart of
    LiquidTemplates.HomeTemplate's `{% include 'layout' %}`.

    Heddle's home.heddle extends layout.heddle via `@@<<{{layout.heddle}}` and overrides the
    layout's `<body:body>` section. Under the current engine that override is not applied on the
    extend path, so the body slot resolves to the layout's empty default (Runners/README.md
    documents the root cause). This view therefore contributes no body content, which is exactly
    what makes it byte-parity with Heddle.
*@
@model Heddle.Performance.Runners.RazorTwinModel
@{
    Layout = "twin-layout.cshtml";
}
